        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual puzzle game features beautiful graphics that make up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Mount Huangshan, located in Huangshan City, Anhui Province, is renowned worldwide for its &quot;Five Wonders&quot;—strange pines, bizarre rocks, sea of clouds, hot springs, and winter snow—along with its historical relics, calligraphy, painting, literature, legends, and famous figures, earning it the titles of &quot;the world's most extraordinary mountain,&quot; &quot;a masterpiece of nature,&quot; and &quot;pine forests, sea of clouds, and river valleys.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144700/extras/ece9dff4bd91eb08fc32ae990450c66f.avif?t=1763215478\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game starts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'start game', the image will be grayed out, and the colored parts will be randomly scrambled into 16 small fragments, scattered randomly on the screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on the small image, drag it to its original position to restore it, until all the small images move to the correct position, and the game ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End or start the next game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the small fragments move to the correct position, and the game ends. At this point, click &quot;try again&quot; to repeat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
